  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inception mission on (green) hydrogen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The target of this missionis twofold:To offer civil servants (2/3) as well as professionals within the private/semipublic sector (1/3) from Algeria, Egypt, Kuwait and Morocco a knowledge exchange, dialogue and training on (green) hydrogen and,To establish the basis of a well-functioning ecosystem of (green) hydrogen and its required needs, to in the end ensure the export of (green) hydrogen.</narrative>
  </description>
